Basically if you add modifiers that make the game harder you get a positive score multiplier. 

Example: You make the cops faster and the base price of items is increase by 10% could add a 0.30x score multiplier. That's 0.20 for the cops and 0.10 for the price increase.

If you add modifiers that make the game easier then you have your score multiplier reduced which means you gain less score overall. Some easy mode modifiers could even disable scouring entirely if their considered basically cheats like removing the cops entirely or making everything free.

